{
  "description": "R11: Settings exports the graph to the fixture path as JSON whose link set equals the seed; after the graph is emptied, importing that file restores graph_stats and the a11y counts",
  "requirement": "R11 (GPUI Phase 1)",
  "notes": [
    "Seed: graph-backlinks.json (5 resources, 3 links). export_path and import_path are the same fixture-supplied file, so this is a true export -> import round trip with no dialog (O4).",
    "graph_stats = the graph step's resource_count/link_count read from the instance's ubilink-graph.sqlite; the a11y count is the stats line, worded as the Tauri settings view does (B1): '<resources> link(s) · <links> connection(s)' (README contract).",
    "The 'empty-graph fixture': seed_graph with replace clears the live graph (like LinkGraph::clear) and imports graph-empty.json. Import merges, so importing an empty file alone could never empty the graph.",
    "Settings re-reads the counts each time it is shown (README contract), so it is closed and reopened after the out-of-band change."
  ],
  "setup": {
    "graph": "graph-backlinks.json",
    "fixtures": {
      "export_path": "{root}/roundtrip-export.json",
      "import_path": "{root}/roundtrip-export.json"
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "graph": true,
      "resource_count": 5,
      "link_count": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "open settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a11y counts",
      "see": {
        "role": "Label",
        "text": "5 links · 3 connections"
      },
      "exact": true,
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "no export yet",
      "file": "{root}/roundtrip-export.json",
      "exists": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Tab to Export",
      "key_until": {
        "role": "Button",
        "text": "Export",
        "state": {
          "focused": true
        }
      },
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "enter"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "exported to the fixture path as ubilink.graph.v3",
      "file": "{root}/roundtrip-export.json",
      "expect": {
        "schema": "ubilink.graph.v3",
        "resources": {
          "len": 5
        },
        "links": {
          "len": 3
        }
      },
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "its link set equals the seed",
      "graph": true,
      "export": "{root}/roundtrip-export.json",
      "links": [
        [
          "https://subject.example/note",
          "https://alpha.example/one"
        ],
        [
          "https://subject.example/note",
          "https://beta.example/two"
        ],
        [
          "https://subject.example/note",
          "https://gamma.example/three"
        ]
      ],
      "link_count": 3,
      "resource_count": 5
    },
    {
      "name": "empty the graph (empty-graph fixture)",
      "seed_graph": "graph-empty.json",
      "replace": true
    },
    {
      "graph": true,
      "resource_count": 0,
      "link_count": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "close settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": false,
        "route": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "reopen settings",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "settings"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a11y counts read 0",
      "see": {
        "role": "Label",
        "text": "0 links · 0 connections"
      },
      "exact": true,
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "Tab to Import",
      "key_until": {
        "role": "Button",
        "text": "Import",
        "state": {
          "focused": true
        }
      },
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "enter"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "graph_stats equal the original",
      "graph": true,
      "links": [
        [
          "https://subject.example/note",
          "https://alpha.example/one"
        ],
        [
          "https://subject.example/note",
          "https://beta.example/two"
        ],
        [
          "https://subject.example/note",
          "https://gamma.example/three"
        ]
      ],
      "resource_count": 5,
      "link_count": 3,
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "a11y counts equal the original",
      "see": {
        "role": "Label",
        "text": "5 links · 3 connections"
      },
      "exact": true,
      "route": "settings",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing launched",
      "call": "opened",
      "expect": {
        "": {
          "eq": []
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
